# DeFi Analytics

Lux can combine DeFiLlama protocol/yield data with Dune query results into
protocol analytics, dashboards, and alerts.

The integration covers:

- TVL tracking
- protocol metric collection
- yield analytics
- volume and historical series processing
- Dune custom query execution and result retrieval
- dashboard data generation
- alert events for TVL drops and high-yield pools

## API Collection

```elixir
alias Lux.Integrations.DeFiAnalytics.Client

Client.protocols()
Client.protocol("aave")
Client.yield_pools()
Client.dex_volume_overview()
Client.dex_volume_summary("uniswap")
Client.dune_latest_result(123456, api_key: System.fetch_env!("DUNE_API_KEY"))
Client.dune_execute_sql("select * from dex.trades limit 10", api_key: System.fetch_env!("DUNE_API_KEY"))
```

## Analytics

```elixir
alias Lux.Integrations.DeFiAnalytics.Analytics

protocols = [
  %{"name" => "Aave", "slug" => "aave", "tvl" => 1_000_000_000, "change_7d" => -12}
]

yields = %{
  "data" => [
    %{"pool" => "pool-1", "project" => "aave", "chain" => "Ethereum", "tvlUsd" => 5_000_000, "apy" => 24.5}
  ]
}

Analytics.dashboard(protocols, yields, min_yield_apy: 20, tvl_drop_pct: 10)
```

Dashboard output includes totals, top protocols, top yield pools, and alert
events ready for agents or UI surfaces.
